{"4010020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Patchwork Home", "steam_appid": 4010020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A love story about how even in a broken world, you can still be made to feel whole. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Patchwork Home, players will be able to pick up the pieces of a comically broken world and build a home. But it won't be easy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight to protect your home</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010020/extras/ab0c6af263637fac635cea11ce9a89fa.poster.avif?t=1783727697\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010020/extras/ab0c6af263637fac635cea11ce9a89fa.webm?t=1783727697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010020/extras/ab0c6af263637fac635cea11ce9a89fa.mp4?t=1783727697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What a strange landlord</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Prototype story) You awake on the grass, while a robot i watches over you. Your new landlord. He has also brought your best friend, Tony, and a random woman. None of you mind, because any shelter in a world that has gone through 99 apocalypses is welcome. But then again... why does it watch you so intently? And why is it so interested in collecting favors?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010020/extras/4035266d5b3642d24068e1fac42772f4.avif?t=1783727697\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010020/extras_big/4035266d5b3642d24068e1fac42772f4.webp?t=1783727697 width=1560 height=786 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In the calm, heal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time passes, you'll share meals, moments and more. And with every passing day, you will see these characters slowly come out of their shell (a bit more quickly because this is the prototype) and begin to heal from the never ending chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010020/extras/955512ed83460fb6c4cd2d84d8edbaab.avif?t=1783727697\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010020/extras_big/955512ed83460fb6c4cd2d84d8edbaab.webp?t=1783727697 width=1560 height=796 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspire them to more</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend time with a cast of five unforgettable characters and experience their trials and their stories. You will inspire them to invest in a world that does not seem worth investing in. Invest in the home that you are building together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010020/extras/fcedc3cbad07a46695c666d2ef99ccdd.avif?t=1783727697\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010020/extras_big/fcedc3cbad07a46695c666d2ef99ccdd.webp?t=1783727697 width=1560 height=844 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And in the end of it all, you will inspire them to invest in you. In the love that you share. You will inspire them (okay, Fernanda) to draw you as a gorilla.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010020/extras/af7fee512f0b7a80f3637eb93c0a5f28.avif?t=1783727697\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010020/extras_big/af7fee512f0b7a80f3637eb93c0a5f28.avif?t=1783727697 width=1560 height=1988 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight chaos with (managed) chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has broken countless times, and it will break again. Unless you stop it.  Fight your way through horrifying and surreal dungeons, where you not only face the chaos, but manage it. Stack the deck in your favor with our unique combat system that mixes <strong>strategic deckbuilding</strong> mechanics with <strong>high-paced hack &amp; slash combat.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010020/extras/b50ca713ecc0b7c72a4e39637f704396.poster.avif?t=1783727697\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010020/extras/b50ca713ecc0b7c72a4e39637f704396.webm?t=1783727697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010020/extras/b50ca713ecc0b7c72a4e39637f704396.mp4?t=1783727697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A love story about how even in a broken world, you can still be made to feel whole. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Patchwork Home, players will be able to pick up the pieces of a comically broken world and build a home. But it won't be easy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight to protect your home</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010020/extras/ab0c6af263637fac635cea11ce9a89fa.poster.avif?t=1783727697\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010020/extras/ab0c6af263637fac635cea11ce9a89fa.webm?t=1783727697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010020/extras/ab0c6af263637fac635cea11ce9a89fa.mp4?t=1783727697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What a strange landlord</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Prototype story) You awake on the grass, while a robot i watches over you. Your new landlord. He has also brought your best friend, Tony, and a random woman. None of you mind, because any shelter in a world that has gone through 99 apocalypses is welcome. But then again... why does it watch you so intently? And why is it so interested in collecting favors?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010020/extras/4035266d5b3642d24068e1fac42772f4.avif?t=1783727697\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010020/extras_big/4035266d5b3642d24068e1fac42772f4.webp?t=1783727697 width=1560 height=786 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In the calm, heal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time passes, you'll share meals, moments and more. And with every passing day, you will see these characters slowly come out of their shell (a bit more quickly because this is the prototype) and begin to heal from the never ending chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010020/extras/955512ed83460fb6c4cd2d84d8edbaab.avif?t=1783727697\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010020/extras_big/955512ed83460fb6c4cd2d84d8edbaab.webp?t=1783727697 width=1560 height=796 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspire them to more</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend time with a cast of five unforgettable characters and experience their trials and their stories. You will inspire them to invest in a world that does not seem worth investing in. Invest in the home that you are building together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010020/extras/fcedc3cbad07a46695c666d2ef99ccdd.avif?t=1783727697\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010020/extras_big/fcedc3cbad07a46695c666d2ef99ccdd.webp?t=1783727697 width=1560 height=844 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And in the end of it all, you will inspire them to invest in you. In the love that you share. You will inspire them (okay, Fernanda) to draw you as a gorilla.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010020/extras/af7fee512f0b7a80f3637eb93c0a5f28.avif?t=1783727697\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010020/extras_big/af7fee512f0b7a80f3637eb93c0a5f28.avif?t=1783727697 width=1560 height=1988 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight chaos with (managed) chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has broken countless times, and it will break again. Unless you stop it.  Fight your way through horrifying and surreal dungeons, where you not only face the chaos, but manage it. Stack the deck in your favor with our unique combat system that mixes <strong>strategic deckbuilding</strong> mechanics with <strong>high-paced hack &amp; slash combat.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010020/extras/b50ca713ecc0b7c72a4e39637f704396.poster.avif?t=1783727697\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass